{"title":"1998 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/2/7d2a0ce57325d86917087130b5bb45c279ed14ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\begin{tabular}{r|l}a&amp;b \\\\ \\hline c&amp;d\\end{tabular} = \\text{a}\\cdot \\text{d} - \\text{b}\\cdot \\text{c}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"164\" height=\"40\" />, what is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/c/b1cd0753e341ed12d0672470ac1c77b090513cde.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\begin{tabular}{r|l}3&amp;4 \\\\ \\hline 1&amp;2\\end{tabular}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"56\" height=\"40\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/1/531094282cc845a04ca6e9ba5c670ccea5bfb7e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ -2 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ -1 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 0 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 1 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"377\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Plugging in values for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, we get\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/0/340605c5f88cf6864adc5b146c3dffca7a45df22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />, \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/a/fda5328bc4703ff88e62aa83ea58ae4e8361f5ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" />, \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/4/0e4cc644ec8a1c3623c13ed3d14904096a0d87b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />, \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/8/588e07a0cfc1e617ac5d6552a759b3011aa96d6c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d=2$\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />, \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/6/626441ac05c9c7868fdba1a0291817eae28261b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\times d=3\\times2=6$\" width=\"138\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/d/74d10fd852d2690a6ceb93a0e47911269a9ff243.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b\\times c=4\\times1=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"136\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/6/d56aacf9a0d82d29b182703eb0e93c4ba73c3149.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6-4=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"73\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/2/55206bce678ac0394d97dc04dd72398df2bdf572.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{E}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME\" title=\"1998 AJHSME\">1998 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1998\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Problems/Problem